OL,5,G1135 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe last visit of the week is to
OL,7,     FThe Pheasant in Brill,
OL,8,     FBuckinghamshire, where fur flies
OL,9,     Fas host and chef Stephen Orr
OL,10,     Freveals that he hasn't been
OL,11,     Fentirely honest with his guests.
OL,12,G1210 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FIt's the final day of the
OL,14,     Fcompetition and the B&Bers meet
OL,15,     Ffor the last time to find out how
OL,16,     Fmuch they've been paid and to
OL,17,     Fsettle some scores, before the
OL,18,     Fwinner is announced.
