OL,6,     FBoston, Lincolnshire. The first
OL,7,     Fhost is 23-year-old trainee
OL,8,     Faccountant Annika, a
OL,9,     Fself-confessed hippy and
OL,10,     Fhunter-gatherer. Will her love of
OL,11,     Fgame spoil her chances? (Ep1/5)
OL,12,G1310 Come Dine with Me
OL,13,     FBoston, Lincolnshire. Katy, who
OL,14,     Floves a competition, is convinced
OL,15,     Fthat she can win with her
OL,16,     Fsuper-organised approach and
OL,17,     F'prize-winning' cuisine. But she
OL,18,     Fclashes with Carolyn. (Ep2/5)
