OL,5,G1650 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe B&Bers are in the heart of
OL,7,     FBirmingham for the week's final
OL,8,     Fvisit, to The Ladbrooke Hotel.
OL,9,     FHost Snehal aims for perfection,
OL,10,     Fbut some guests think their rooms
OL,11,     Fare far from flawless.
